  "notes": "{当|あ}てはまる means that something fits, matches, or is applicable to a condition, category, or description.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n- Pair: {当|あ}てはめる (transitive — \"to apply something to\")\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{当|あ}てはまっている indicates a continuing state of being applicable.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {条件|じょうけん}に{当|あ}てはまる: to meet the conditions\n- {基準|きじゅん}に{当|あ}てはまる: to meet the standard\n- ぴったり{当|あ}てはまる: to fit perfectly\n- すべてに{当|あ}てはまる: to apply to everything\n\nUSAGE:\nThe particle pattern is AがBに{当|あ}てはまる (A applies to B / A fits B). Often used in negative: {当|あ}てはまらない (doesn't apply).",
